# Root Environment Variables Template
# ====================================
# 
# This monorepo uses per-app environment validation.
# See the following files for app-specific variables:
#
# Frontend (TanStack Start):
#   apps/web/.env.example
#
# Backend (Fastify):
#   apps/server/.env.example
#
# Each app validates its own environment variables at startup.
# Copy the relevant .env.example files and rename to .env
